@page "/about"

<PageTitle>About Elevated Notary Services | Brittany &amp; Jimmy Smith — Cleveland, TN</PageTitle>
<HeadContent>
    <meta name="description" content="Meet Brittany and Jimmy Smith, co-owners of Elevated Notary Services in Cleveland, Tennessee. Built on reliability, proactive communication, and $1,000,000 E&amp;O insured signing standards." />
</HeadContent>

<section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
        <span class="eyebrow eyebrow-light">About Elevated Notary Services</span>
        <h1>Reliability Isn't an Extra — It's Our Standard.</h1>
        <p>
            Rooted in Southeast Tennessee and coordinating loan signings across all 50 states, Elevated Notary Services was built around preparation, accountability, and genuine care for every client.
        </p>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
    <div class="container split-feature">
        <div>
            <span class="eyebrow">Our Mission &amp; Vision</span>
            <h2 class="section-title">Raising the Standard for Notary &amp; Signing Services</h2>
            <p style="color:var(--text-body); margin-bottom:1rem;">
                We believe clients and industry partners deserve more than simply having a document notarized. They deserve clear communication, reliable service, attention to detail, and professionals who take their role seriously.
            </p>
            <p style="color:var(--text-body); margin-bottom:1rem;">
                With over six years of hands-on experience in loan signings and notarization across multiple platforms, Elevated Notary Services combines local Cleveland, TN expertise with a vetted nationwide network of independent signing professionals — backed by <strong>$1,000,000 in Errors &amp; Omissions coverage</strong>.
            </p>
            <div style="display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:0.75rem; margin-top:1.5rem;">
                <a href="/title-lender-solutions" class="btn btn-navy">Title &amp; Lender Solutions</a>
                <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-outline-navy">Visit Our Storefront</a>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-image-wrap">
            <img src="/images/closing-room.webp" alt="Elevated Notary Services private closing room in Cleveland, TN" loading="lazy" />
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-alt">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="section-header centered">
            <span class="eyebrow">Leadership</span>
            <h2 class="section-title">Meet the Co-Owners</h2>
            <p class="section-lead">
                Husband-and-wife leadership committed to dependable service, strong partner relationships, and excellence on every assignment.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid-2">
            <article class="card">
                <span class="eyebrow">Co-Owner &amp; Founder</span>
                <h3 style="margin-top:0.35rem;">Brittany Smith</h3>
                <p>
                    With more than six years of experience in the notary and loan signing industry, Brittany founded Elevated Notary Services and leads daily operations, client relationships, signing coordination, quality control, and the expansion of ENS's nationwide notary network.
                </p>
                <p style="margin-bottom:0; color:var(--text-muted); font-size:0.9rem;">
                    Her approach is built on proactive communication, accountability, and treating every transaction with precision and care.
                </p>
            </article>

            <article class="card">
                <span class="eyebrow">Co-Owner</span>
                <h3 style="margin-top:0.35rem;">Jimmy Smith</h3>
                <p>
                    As a Tennessee-commissioned Notary Public and co-owner, Jimmy brings a hands-on operational approach to Elevated Notary Services — supporting local storefront and mobile clients while strengthening ENS's national operations and partner relationships.
                </p>
                <p style="margin-bottom:0; color:var(--text-muted); font-size:0.9rem;">
                    Together, Brittany and Jimmy lead ENS with a shared commitment to building trust through every interaction.
                </p>
            </article>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-stone">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="section-header centered">
            <span class="eyebrow">Core Pillars</span>
            <h2 class="section-title">Why Partners Choose Elevated Notary Services</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="grid-4">
            <div class="card">
                <h3 style="font-size:1.3rem;">Professional Standards</h3>
                <p style="margin:0;">Reliable, prepared, and committed to quality execution on every signing.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <h3 style="font-size:1.3rem;">Proactive Communication</h3>
                <p style="margin:0;">Clear, timely updates from initial order intake through final delivery.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <h3 style="font-size:1.3rem;">Vetted Notary Network</h3>
                <p style="margin:0;">Qualified coverage matched to exact location and transaction requirements.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <h3 style="font-size:1.3rem;">Client-Focused Care</h3>
                <p style="margin:0;">We protect your information, respect your deadlines, and own the outcome.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
